                                                                  iterative gains. A possible reason for this phenomenon is that
                                                                  the short cycles greatly affect the error performance, which
                                                                  makes the L(Bj)s in (4) not independent. Therefore, since
                                                                  bit-interleaving between multiple codewords and high coding
                                                                  rates can reduce the short cycles in a large probability, better
                                                                  error performance can be expected.

